+## Player programs and interaction audit
+
+See `docs/1.3-AUDIT.md` and the new `programs.test.js`, `ui_acceptance_programs.py`, and `ui_acceptance_performance.py` suites. Program definitions live in the session’s `playerPrograms` extension; opted-in future configuration lives in `uiLayout.savedPrograms`. `tableGrids` preserves detached-zone slot arrays. These are data-only presentation/player preferences, while `RUN_SEQUENCE` uses a single reversible engine transaction and is reproduced by engine history.
